WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:40.947 --> 00:01:43.183
Tenchi!

00:01:43.183 --> 00:01:45.152
Tenchi, Tenchi!

00:01:45.152 --> 00:01:48.622
Come home soon!

00:01:48.622 --> 00:01:52.922
Tenchi, come back!

00:02:02.135 --> 00:02:03.003
"Bullet Train 'Hikari' Dep. 9:42 for Okayama"

00:02:03.003 --> 00:02:05.071
"Bullet Train 'Hikari' Dep. 9:42 for Okayama"
I didn't know you were heading home today.

00:02:05.071 --> 00:02:05.639
I didn't know you were heading home today.

00:02:05.639 --> 00:02:07.607
Did something happen, Masaki?

00:02:07.607 --> 00:02:10.177
No, it's nothing serious.

00:02:10.177 --> 00:02:13.079
Then do you mind if I came along?

00:02:13.079 --> 00:02:16.016
I want to see where you grew up.

00:02:16.016 --> 00:02:19.719
I want to meet your mother and father, too.

00:02:19.719 --> 00:02:22.489
But... It's too sudden! I can't...

00:02:22.489 --> 00:02:23.690
Oh.

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:27.990
You're right. I guess it'd cause
trouble, being asked so suddenly.

00:02:29.896 --> 00:02:32.199
Eat this on the train, okay?

00:02:32.199 --> 00:02:34.267
It's a packed lunch I made for you.

00:02:34.267 --> 00:02:36.102
Thanks.

00:02:36.102 --> 00:02:38.161
Well, be careful.

00:03:08.034 --> 00:03:12.706
"Tenchi Anniversary"

00:03:12.706 --> 00:03:14.941
"Tenchi Anniversary"
Make it pretty, okay, Ayeka?

00:03:14.941 --> 00:03:15.242
Make it pretty, okay, Ayeka?

00:03:15.242 --> 00:03:17.410
Don't worry! Watch!

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:19.275
Sister!

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:24.551
You're so good at that!

00:03:24.551 --> 00:03:25.986
We do this at our part-time job.

00:03:25.986 --> 00:03:29.656
It's fun to make these when you don't
have to worry about making money, huh?

00:03:29.656 --> 00:03:30.857
You're right!

00:03:30.857 --> 00:03:34.227
If we don't make a hundred more
of these, we won't make any money!

00:03:34.227 --> 00:03:35.694
Sorry!

00:03:37.631 --> 00:03:40.100
Be careful, Washu!

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:42.302
My hand slipped.

00:03:42.302 --> 00:03:42.335
"Out of order due to sunspots!"
My hand slipped.

00:03:42.335 --> 00:03:45.272
"Out of order due to sunspots!"
We won't be able to use the
Dimension Tunnel for a while.

00:03:45.272 --> 00:03:45.795
We won't be able to use the
Dimension Tunnel for a while.

00:03:46.106 --> 00:03:48.608
Washu, what's this?

00:03:48.608 --> 00:03:50.508
Don't fiddle with that!

00:03:52.812 --> 00:03:54.643
Let go of it!

00:03:57.617 --> 00:03:59.119
Are you okay, Kiyone?

00:03:59.119 --> 00:04:01.054
Mihoshi, you little...

00:04:01.054 --> 00:04:06.651
Don't get mad! Today's a special day!

00:04:09.396 --> 00:04:10.430
I guess you're right.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.432
Right.

00:04:12.432 --> 00:04:13.797
Yep.

00:04:26.313 --> 00:04:30.215
It seems like so long ago...

00:04:37.724 --> 00:04:39.316
Oops.

00:04:46.499 --> 00:04:48.490
Tenchi Anniversary, huh?

00:04:49.069 --> 00:04:52.038
It was a day like today.

00:04:54.374 --> 00:04:58.678
If I hadn't come to Earth
when Ayeka was chasing me,

00:04:58.678 --> 00:05:01.374
I never would have met Tenchi.

00:05:15.729 --> 00:05:18.932
Direct hit to defensive screen with blasters.

00:05:18.932 --> 00:05:23.937
Screen reflection ratio
at 88%. Still no effect.

00:05:23.937 --> 00:05:27.073
Never mind! Continue firing!

00:05:27.073 --> 00:05:28.908
Damn you, space pirate Ryoko...

00:05:28.908 --> 00:05:32.245
Why, of all things, did you
have to steal the Jurai Lightstone?

00:05:32.245 --> 00:05:38.051
Come on, Sister... We should
let the Galaxy Police handle this.

00:05:38.051 --> 00:05:40.453
What are you saying, Sasami?

00:05:40.453 --> 00:05:44.224
That stone is one of the treasures
handed down in the Jurai royal house!

00:05:44.224 --> 00:05:46.192
I can't possibly leave
something so precious

00:05:46.192 --> 00:05:51.331
to the Galaxy Police, who have
let Ryoko escape time and again!

00:05:51.331 --> 00:05:52.866
Um...

00:05:52.866 --> 00:05:55.402
We can hear you.

00:05:55.402 --> 00:06:00.607
Lady Ayeka, Headquarters
requests that you leave this to us.

00:06:00.607 --> 00:06:02.075
And you are?

00:06:02.075 --> 00:06:05.045
Galaxy Police Detective First Grade Kiyone!

00:06:05.045 --> 00:06:06.880
And I'm Mihoshi! Ditto!

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:11.518
There's no need to worry.
You two move in to arrest Ryoko as well.

00:06:11.518 --> 00:06:12.780
Yes, Ma'am!

00:06:14.354 --> 00:06:15.753
This is great!

00:06:18.158 --> 00:06:22.295
If we manage to arrest Ryoko,
we're looking at a promotion and raise,

00:06:22.295 --> 00:06:24.464
and we'll be able to return to headquarters!

00:06:24.464 --> 00:06:27.367
We may never get another chance like this!

00:06:27.367 --> 00:06:30.770
Please, Mihoshi! Just
this once, don't screw up!

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:32.372
Just leave it to me!

00:06:32.372 --> 00:06:35.141
This is the Galaxy Police!

00:06:35.141 --> 00:06:39.012
You in the spaceship! Pull over!

00:06:39.012 --> 00:06:39.946
That's...

00:06:39.946 --> 00:06:42.048
A giant laser cannon!

00:06:42.048 --> 00:06:43.606
Break off!

00:06:50.724 --> 00:06:52.248
Ryo-Ohki!

00:06:54.627 --> 00:06:58.098
N-Now you've done it, space pirate!

00:06:58.098 --> 00:07:02.302
I'll give you a taste of the
power of this new battleship Ayesa!

00:07:02.302 --> 00:07:05.171
Azaka! Kamidake!
Launch torpedoes, full spread!

00:07:05.171 --> 00:07:06.604
- Aye!
- Aye!

00:07:13.546 --> 00:07:15.537
How do you like that?

00:07:19.385 --> 00:07:21.478
L-Impossible!

00:07:27.393 --> 00:07:28.962
Forget about it!

00:07:28.962 --> 00:07:33.900
A peashooter like that can't break
through my Li'I Washu Special Screen!

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:38.705
Still, I've never seen an
energy crystal this shape before...

00:07:38.705 --> 00:07:44.177
So the energy they call the
"Power of Jurai" is hidden in here, huh?

00:07:44.177 --> 00:07:48.047
I wonder what its molecular composition is?

00:07:48.047 --> 00:07:50.150
This baby's got my full attention!

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.218
Forget it, Washu.

00:07:52.218 --> 00:07:54.420
That thing's worth big money.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:08:01.928
Just one of those stones is worth
more than we could spend in 50 lifetimes.

00:08:01.928 --> 00:08:03.496
All right, all right.

00:08:03.496 --> 00:08:07.467
Instead, you're gonna get me that
top of the line particle converter, right?

00:08:07.467 --> 00:08:12.071
I'm helping out the likes of you, remember.

00:08:12.071 --> 00:08:13.606
I don't work cheap.

00:08:13.606 --> 00:08:15.742
Okay, okay.

00:08:15.742 --> 00:08:19.405
Man, that Jurai princess is persistent.

00:08:21.147 --> 00:08:22.248
What the?

00:08:22.248 --> 00:08:24.884
Oops. Looks like we're out of energy.

00:08:24.884 --> 00:08:25.985
What?!

00:08:25.985 --> 00:08:31.491
My defensive screen is effective,
but it's a real energy hog!

00:08:31.491 --> 00:08:34.016
You're the one who made it, damn it!

00:08:36.596 --> 00:08:40.333
Defensive screen down.
Reaction engine output falling.

00:08:40.333 --> 00:08:42.702
We're in serious trouble here.

00:08:42.702 --> 00:08:45.205
Come on, Washu, can't you do something?

00:08:45.205 --> 00:08:48.575
That all depends on whether or
not I can find us an energy supply.

00:08:48.575 --> 00:08:52.045
But where are we gonna find something
like that in this backwater system?

00:08:52.045 --> 00:08:53.046
Perfect!

00:08:53.046 --> 00:08:55.682
I'm picking up a huge energy signature

00:08:55.682 --> 00:08:58.310
on that solar system's
third planet! It's called Earth!

00:09:06.893 --> 00:09:08.661
Defensive screen is down.

00:09:08.661 --> 00:09:10.496
Attack is now effective.

00:09:10.496 --> 00:09:13.666
Good. You're not getting away from me...

00:09:13.666 --> 00:09:16.936
Second and third
reaction engines, off-line!

00:09:16.936 --> 00:09:19.706
All right then, we'll just
punch it and head straight for Earth!

00:09:19.706 --> 00:09:22.174
Hold on tight, Washu!

00:09:29.148 --> 00:09:30.216
They're making a break for it!

00:09:30.216 --> 00:09:31.851
After them!

00:09:31.851 --> 00:09:33.019
Maximum acceleration!

00:09:33.019 --> 00:09:34.384
Aye!

00:09:39.759 --> 00:09:41.818
There it is! Earth!

00:09:48.501 --> 00:09:50.136
They're headed for Earth?

00:09:50.136 --> 00:09:53.037
Kiyone! Look at the rear monitor!

00:09:54.941 --> 00:09:57.102
What is that?

00:10:00.446 --> 00:10:04.017
Lady Ayeka, what are you trying to do?

00:10:04.017 --> 00:10:08.488
I'll stop that ship with our ultimate
weapon, the Thunder Flash Cannon.

00:10:08.488 --> 00:10:11.424
Board the ship and
retrieve the Jurai Lightstone!

00:10:11.424 --> 00:10:12.458
Understood!

00:10:12.458 --> 00:10:13.927
Target lock.

00:10:13.927 --> 00:10:17.931
They have the Lightstone on
board. You mustn't destroy them!

00:10:17.931 --> 00:10:19.933
Certainly, Princess Ayeka.

00:10:19.933 --> 00:10:24.637
We will regulate the
output so as to disable them.

00:10:24.637 --> 00:10:25.872
This is bad news.

00:10:25.872 --> 00:10:28.608
That princess is about to
cut loose with something nasty.

00:10:28.608 --> 00:10:31.372
Do you think I'm gonna
let her do that, moron?

00:10:33.313 --> 00:10:35.281
Fire Thunder Flash Cannon!

00:10:46.793 --> 00:10:48.283
Princess!

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:58.771
It's no use! We're going down!

00:10:58.771 --> 00:11:00.473
We're going down! We're going down!

00:11:00.473 --> 00:11:04.711
We're being pulled in by some
energy I've never seen before!

00:11:04.711 --> 00:11:05.845
What?

00:11:05.845 --> 00:11:08.348
Pirate ship is entering atmosphere.

00:11:08.348 --> 00:11:11.451
I won't let them get away. Take us in, too!

00:11:11.451 --> 00:11:12.418
Aye!

00:11:12.418 --> 00:11:13.976
Sister...

00:11:17.357 --> 00:11:20.493
Oh, man! I'm so late for my evening chores!

00:11:20.493 --> 00:11:22.961
Grandpa's gonna be mad!

00:11:25.865 --> 00:11:27.560
What the heck?

00:11:30.803 --> 00:11:33.271
I've located the high-order energy signature!

00:12:02.101 --> 00:12:04.001
Why?

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:12.877
Why can't Masaki understand how I feel?

00:12:18.451 --> 00:12:20.351
Okayama...

00:12:22.355 --> 00:12:24.255
Okay, that settles it!

00:12:28.995 --> 00:12:30.963
What're you doing, Sister?

00:12:32.098 --> 00:12:35.334
He's late! Tenchi's late!

00:12:35.334 --> 00:12:38.132
He should have arrived a long time ago!

00:12:39.205 --> 00:12:41.841
You don't suppose he got into
some sort of accident, do you?

00:12:41.841 --> 00:12:44.010
You worry too much, Sister.

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:46.312
He'll just show up out of nowhere.

00:12:46.312 --> 00:12:48.507
Just like when we first met him.

00:12:52.151 --> 00:12:55.314
Right. Just like when we met.

00:13:18.644 --> 00:13:21.981
No life signs detected within the ship.

00:13:21.981 --> 00:13:24.745
They seem to have
abandoned the ship and fled.

00:13:28.087 --> 00:13:31.924
They can't have gone far.
We'll track them down!

00:13:31.924 --> 00:13:33.152
Aye!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:48.875
Why am I being hunted down
on a backwater planet like this?

00:13:48.875 --> 00:13:53.209
If you have a problem with it,
go and get caught by the Galaxy Police.

00:13:54.313 --> 00:13:55.748
You're kidding, right?

00:13:55.748 --> 00:14:02.288
Nobody has the right to throw a
genius scientist like me into prison!

00:14:02.288 --> 00:14:07.527
Anyway, it'd be a blow to scientific
development all across the universe!

00:14:07.527 --> 00:14:10.563
Don't worry, don't worry.
Just leave everything to me.

00:14:10.563 --> 00:14:12.087
First...

00:14:13.032 --> 00:14:16.602
First, we capture that guy and
help ourselves to that energy.

00:14:16.602 --> 00:14:20.806
Then we repair the ship
and kiss this planet goodbye.

00:14:20.806 --> 00:14:25.678
Right. But why is that guy giving
off such a high energy reading?

00:14:25.678 --> 00:14:28.340
He looked like a normal lifeform to me.

00:14:29.982 --> 00:14:31.472
Washu!

00:14:33.753 --> 00:14:35.988
Persistence is one thing,
but this is ridiculous!

00:14:35.988 --> 00:14:38.791
Searching. Searching. Searching.

00:14:38.791 --> 00:14:41.453
Searching. Searching.

00:14:42.161 --> 00:14:44.597
Biological signature verified ahead.

00:14:44.597 --> 00:14:46.565
We've found you, Ryoko.

00:15:05.051 --> 00:15:08.111
Things have sure gotten bad, Ryo-Ohki...

00:15:09.555 --> 00:15:13.389
You know, this planet
sure looks a lot like Jurai...

00:15:30.343 --> 00:15:32.178
Stupid princess...

00:15:32.178 --> 00:15:35.705
If you hadn't followed us, you would've
gotten away with your life intact.

00:15:39.952 --> 00:15:40.886
What?!

00:15:40.886 --> 00:15:43.823
I'm sorry, did you do something just now?

00:15:43.823 --> 00:15:49.262
You really shouldn't underestimate
the power of Ayeka, First Princess of Jurai.

00:15:49.262 --> 00:15:54.467
Now, space pirate Ryoko...
Will you return the Jurai Lightstone?

00:15:54.467 --> 00:15:58.665
You think I'll just hand it
over quietly when you tell me to?

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:06.012
You want it? Come take it, Princess.

00:16:06.012 --> 00:16:07.880
Princess, just...

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:09.404
...leave this to us.

00:16:10.916 --> 00:16:15.182
A couple of Guardians shouldn't
think that they're a match for me!

00:16:19.825 --> 00:16:20.726
You're pretty good.

00:16:20.726 --> 00:16:22.353
- I am, at that.
- Now attacking!

00:16:24.864 --> 00:16:26.354
Ryoko!

00:16:32.705 --> 00:16:34.940
Your insolence thus far is intolerable,

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:39.912
but if you return the Lightstone
to the Princess, we will let it slide.

00:16:39.912 --> 00:16:43.549
Return the Jurai Lightstone,
and then leave at once!

00:16:43.549 --> 00:16:45.418
I got careless...

00:16:45.418 --> 00:16:48.788
Guardians of the royal family
are a whole different breed.

00:16:48.788 --> 00:16:51.222
But how about this?!

00:16:53.559 --> 00:16:56.429
No matter how many times
you try, an attack like that won't...

00:16:56.429 --> 00:16:58.590
- She's gone!
- Where did she go?!

00:16:59.565 --> 00:17:03.469
However tough you are,
you can't dodge at this range.

00:17:03.469 --> 00:17:05.232
'Bye!

00:17:10.443 --> 00:17:12.511
Azaka! Kamidake! Are you all right?

00:17:12.511 --> 00:17:14.380
Thank you, Princess.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.881
You saved us!

00:17:15.881 --> 00:17:17.143
Ryoko!

00:17:18.217 --> 00:17:19.819
Now they've gone and done it...

00:17:19.819 --> 00:17:24.824
Now you've learned, haven't you?
Such attacks won't work against me.

00:17:24.824 --> 00:17:27.626
Now, return the Jurai Lightstone.

00:17:27.626 --> 00:17:31.797
Get real! If my only other
choice is to give it to you...

00:17:31.797 --> 00:17:33.466
What do you think you're doing?

00:17:33.466 --> 00:17:35.634
No, Ryoko! Don't!

00:17:35.634 --> 00:17:41.300
I'll kill you all with the Power
of Jurai that's inside this thing!

00:17:44.276 --> 00:17:45.675
Lmpossible!

00:17:58.791 --> 00:18:00.593
Ayeka!

00:18:00.593 --> 00:18:03.195
Azaka! Kamidake!

00:18:03.195 --> 00:18:05.493
Where'd they go?

00:18:06.499 --> 00:18:09.229
Sister! Azaka! Kamidake!

00:18:15.508 --> 00:18:17.343
There are humans on this planet, too?!

00:18:17.343 --> 00:18:20.846
A girl? What's a little girl doing out here?

00:18:20.846 --> 00:18:22.181
What're you doing here, kid?

00:18:22.181 --> 00:18:25.017
Where did you come from?
Where are your mom and dad?

00:18:25.017 --> 00:18:27.953
I, uh... I got lost.

00:18:27.953 --> 00:18:31.290
Something huge crashed
into that mountain a while ago!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.958
It might set off a forest fire!

00:18:32.958 --> 00:18:35.127
We shouldn't stay here! Let's go!

00:18:35.127 --> 00:18:36.617
Wait!

00:18:39.031 --> 00:18:40.132
Sister!

00:18:40.132 --> 00:18:41.622
Kid!

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.672
Azaka! Kamidake!

00:18:46.672 --> 00:18:50.506
Incredible! So this is the
Power of Jurai that was in that crystal!

00:19:01.387 --> 00:19:03.218
What incredible power!

00:19:05.724 --> 00:19:07.749
Sister!

00:19:08.561 --> 00:19:10.429
Sister!

00:19:10.429 --> 00:19:12.522
Sasami! Stay away!

00:19:13.866 --> 00:19:14.834
Sister!

00:19:14.834 --> 00:19:16.135
Are you okay?

00:19:16.135 --> 00:19:17.136
Who are you?

00:19:17.136 --> 00:19:19.104
What the heck is that monster?!

00:19:19.104 --> 00:19:21.265
You're in danger! Get away!

00:19:35.855 --> 00:19:37.890
Mom's crystals?

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:41.694
That's it! That's the energy
field that brought us down!

00:19:41.694 --> 00:19:43.262
What the heck is it?

00:19:43.262 --> 00:19:45.628
What the heck's going on around here?!

00:20:15.928 --> 00:20:18.597
What... What have I done?

00:20:18.597 --> 00:20:20.258
Ryoko!

00:20:23.068 --> 00:20:23.936
Lady Ayeka!

00:20:23.936 --> 00:20:25.904
Are you all right?

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:43.122
I'm finally home.

00:20:43.122 --> 00:20:44.390
It's Tenchi!

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:45.591
Lord Tenchi!

00:20:45.591 --> 00:20:46.692
You're back, huh?

00:20:46.692 --> 00:20:48.294
He's here!

00:20:48.294 --> 00:20:49.595
That was fast!

00:20:49.595 --> 00:20:51.964
Tenchi! I missed you!

00:20:51.964 --> 00:20:53.198
Welcome home!

00:20:53.198 --> 00:20:55.768
Ryoko! Get away from Tenchi!

00:20:55.768 --> 00:21:00.005
What's the problem? Today's the
anniversary of when Tenchi and I met!

00:21:00.005 --> 00:21:02.007
You're not the only one!

00:21:02.007 --> 00:21:04.407
C'mon, Tenchi! Let's party!

00:21:36.208 --> 00:21:39.812
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

